   "id": "45:141c",
   "op": "text",
   "en": "The masked woman stared fixedly at me.\nThe mask had no mouth. There were only two thin slits open around the eyes.\n\"Now, you'll answer my questions, won't you?\"\nThe thing spoke to me.\nThis time it wasn't the voice that spoke straight into my head like before. It was a clear, real voice.\nAnd how eerie that voice was.\nIt was like the noise you hear when you fast-forward a tape.\nThat was what it sounded like.\nShrill, yet strangely muffled, as if it had an echo on it. It was a voice that clung horribly to my ears.\nWas she waiting for my answer to what she'd just asked?\nI swallowed the spit that had pooled in my mouth.{p}How should I answer?\n"
  },
  {
   "id": "45:1650",
   "op": "choice",
   "en": "Yes"
  },
  {
   "id": "45:1658",
   "op": "choice",
   "en": "No"
  },
  {
   "id": "45:1660",
   "op": "text",
   "follows_choice": [
    "45:1650"
   ],
   "en": "\"Yes.\"\nI let it out with my breath.\n\"Let me tell you one thing. I'll know if you lie.\nSo answer honestly, all right?\"\nI nodded.\nRight now, I was seeing something no one in this world should ever see, and going through something no one should ever go through.\nI couldn't shake that feeling.\nThe old saying kept coming back to me: leave the gods alone, and they won't curse you.{p}\"You know the story, don't you? Back when this old school building was still in use, some students taking a make-up class were abandoned by their teacher.\"\n"
  },
  {
   "id": "45:1804",
   "op": "choice",
   "en": "Yes"
  },
  {
   "id": "45:180c",
   "op": "choice",
   "en": "No"
  },
  {
   "id": "45:1814",
   "op": "text",
   "follows_choice": [
    "45:1804"
   ],
   "en": "\"Those students went missing in the girls' restroom here on the third floor.\nYou know that too, don't you?\"\n"
